rd runs 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 that same pair fell to 43% of normal on the middle of the grids, while August to September ran 141% that year. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 27% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 16391 shows a preliminary estimate of 60.9 for July to August 2026, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
